          "question": "e-12933",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "Given that $P(A)=\\dfrac12,$ $P(A \\cap B)=\\dfrac16,$ and $P(A \\cup B)=\\dfrac23,$ find $P(A'\\cup B').$",
