          "question": "e-13035",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/worked-solution",
          "value": "First, we calculate $P(A)$ using the addition law:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(A\\cup B) & =P(A)+P(B)-P(A\\cap B) \\\\ 0.9 & =P(A)+0.6-0.4 \\\\ P(A) & =0.9+0.4-0.6 \\\\ P(A) & =0.7\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P({A}^{\u2032}) & =1-P(A) \\\\  & =1-0.7 \\\\  & =0.3.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
